# Audio extracted from a local Escape From Tarkov install
# (tools/extract_tarkov_sfx.py). Battlestate Games' copyright: fine to use
# locally from a copy you own, not ours to hand out as playable files. Only
# the sealed container is tracked - tools/pack_sfx.py builds it, and the
# passphrase it needs arrives at deploy time from a repository secret.
assets/sfx-eft/*
!assets/sfx-eft/pack.bin
assets/sfx-eft/key.json
